.TH lxc-checkconfig 1 2026-08-01 "" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lxc-checkconfig \- check the current kernel for lxc support 
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
'nh
.fi
.ad l
\fBlxc-checkconfig\fR \kx
.if (\nx>(\n(.l/2)) .nr x (\n(.l/5)
'in \n(.iu+\nxu
'in \n(.iu-\nxu
.ad b
'hy
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
\fBlxc-checkconfig\fR check the current kernel for
lxc support
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.TP 
lxc-checkconfig
check the current kernel.
CONFIG can be set in the environment to an alternate location.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
